          "id": "en-md-1",
          "heading": "Escalation",
          "text": "Escalate any spindle alarm to the mechanical on-call engineer within 15 minutes. Do not reboot the controller before the alarm log is downloaded."
        },
        {
          "id": "en-md-2",
          "heading": "Logs",
          "text": "Alarm logs are exported with the command hxlog export --since 30d --format csv. The export takes about four minutes on a busy controller."
        },
        {
          "id": "en-md-3",
          "heading": "Spares",
          "text": "The spare encoder kit part number is ENC-22-KIT. Only two kits are kept on site; replenishment is triggered by the weekly stock check."
        },
        {
          "id": "en-md-4",
          "heading": "Safety",
          "text": "Lock out the main breaker before opening the control cabinet. Verifying zero voltage is mandatory even after the lockout tag is applied."
        }
